        {
          "text": "Pi meno tit botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubaŋa atye ka wacone ni, ‘Lok man pe dok bigalle. Gin ma awaco-ni bitimme.’ An Rwot Lubaŋa doŋ aloko.”",
